{"id":"xjmcsh75njrjqwsrttb8silvc","title":"AI时代，技术领跑不等于商业制胜","originalTitle":null,"summary":"AI领域的技术领先并不等同于市场维度的商业优势。以Sora文生视频模型为例，其技术先进但高昂的部署成本和有限的适用场景使其难以转化为商业价值。商业竞争力在于场景落地与体系化运营，而非单一技术指标。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=52206&do=blog&id=1560193"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T03:45:35.726Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T03:45:35.726Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表"],"score":27,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}